(setter_touchoff_z -- set work Z zero and invalidate the setter calibration)

(Sets work Z zero at the current position and clears the validity flag on D.)
(A Z zero on new stock puts the workpiece top at a different height, which)
(makes any existing D stale; clearing the flag makes setter_zero abort until)
(setter_cal has run against the new zero. Does not move the machine.)

o<setter_touchoff_z> sub

  G10 L20 P0 Z0

  G10 L2 P9 X0

o<setter_touchoff_z> endsub
